Package: leftcens
Title: Descriptive Statistics and Imputation for Left- and Interval-Censored Data
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Shoji F.",
           family = "Nakayama",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "fabre@nies.go.jp",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7772-0389"))
Description: Tools for analytical and environmental measurement data with a
    three-tier interval-censoring structure (non-detect, detected but not
    quantified, and quantified). Provides a single interval-censored data
    representation consumed by both non-parametric and semi-parametric
    descriptive summaries and by Gibbs-sampling imputation extended to
    per-observation censoring bounds. Classic single-limit (Helsel-style)
    left censoring is handled as a degenerate case of the same model.
